ttps://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHST3VAW5YZ5WG19D7CWXX8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n わードレスだ〜✨可愛すぎる〜😍\n モフモフも嬉しいな♪\n ありがとうございます♡︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHST4VQS3CX9EFQS4MC9K0P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n バラの色が深みがあってとても素敵🌹\n 2✖️4=…..☺️\n ありがとうございます♡︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHST5WGFBPY9K59C8B5W3S9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 黄色のお花がパッと周りの空気まで明るくしてくれてます✨\n この葉っぱみるとなんでかインドネシア思い出す〜笑笑\n ありがとうございます♡︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHST70GD90041VEVR0WY1RM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n とても優しいクリスマスツリー🎄\n 見ているだけで癒されます♪\n ありがとうございます♡︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHST81RRTDYPJR19M13MGS0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ドットの風船も可愛い🎈\n リボンもとっても嬉しい〜！！\n ありがとうございます♡︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHST92D126A29CZEBFRS2S5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n え！謎解き！！！びっくりしましたー！！笑\n 正解を教えてください〜笑笑\n 謎解き花だ〜💐楽し嬉し美しフラワー✨\n ありがとうございます♡︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHSTA2N6XJZW1A0DH6Z8EAP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 四つ葉のクローバー🍀\n とても幸せになりました♪\n 紫の色合いが好きです！！\n ありがとうございます♡︎\n \n \n \n \n …続く！"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-21248":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月28日公開の映画『キセキ－あの日のソビト－』を試写会で観てきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもご存知の、GReeeeNさんが歯医者と歌手、二つの夢を追いかける物語です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が小学5.6年生の頃、GReeeeNさんの「キセキ」が大ブームになり、私自身もGReeeeNさんのアルバムは何枚も持っていましたし毎日聴いていたほど大好きでした!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3BEQ7GPGBZ6QYS5RGZDM2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GReeeeNさんは顔を出さずにデビューされたので、当然今までどのようなご苦労をされてきたのか、どのように過ごされてきたのか何も知らなかったのですが、この映画を観てそんなことがあったんだ…と驚くことばかりでした!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい思いや挫折を繰り返しながらも好きなことに突き進んでいく姿はとても心を打たれました。(T . T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今私は好きなことをやらせてもらえて、両親や周りの方々に感謝しています!!( ⸝⸝•｡•⸝⸝ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3BFW1753PN5M97GZ42HB2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張る勇気をもらえた映画でした!!( ˊᵕˋ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょんこより(o•ᴗ•o)੭⁾⁾"}],"source":"archive"}}